My method of not starving in the early game looked something like this
(your mileage may vary):

1) don't waste lots of time waiting for your pet (you can always tame
more if you're really desperate to loot some shops)
2) #pray when weak
3) descend fairly quickly to either the Mines or Sokoban (I think the
Mines are safer for a Monk, see below)
4) don't wear unnecessary rings (hugely important)
5) if all else fails, the penalty for eating non-vegetarian food is
only a single alignment point.  Most characters who survive ascend
with alignments of +200 or greater, so you shouldn't screw yourself
over if you only do this when absolutely necessary.

